# READMEs stay on official JCC accounts

Checked-in READMEs describe deploying this project in the official JCC accounts. Use `compactconnect.org`, `psypactportal.org`, and their test and beta names.

Inspiring Apps internal-account steps belong in a gitignored `README.ia.md` next to the README they would have changed. The root `.gitignore` already ignores that filename. Keep account ids, `*.iaapi.io` hostnames, and IA-only hosted-zone steps in that file.

```markdown
# README.md
Test uses `test.compact.psypactportal.org` and `app.test.psypactportal.org`.

# README.ia.md
Test backend zone stays `test.psypact.jcc.iaapi.io`. Delegate `app` into the frontend account.
```
